# Admin Panel Company (hard rule)

Before working on Admin Panel Company, Admin “Company” menu, subscription accounting, or future PL Server Gold admin accounting, read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/ADMIN_PANEL_COMPANY_AGENT_RULES.md`.

## Hard boundaries

- Normal company code is read-only for this feature. Do **not** edit normal company UI, `useCompany`, normal `companies/` paths, or normal write/sync helpers.
- Put feature code only in:
  - `src/adminPanelCompany/**`
  - `src/lib/adminPanelCompany/**`
  - `src/lib/adminPanelAccounting/**`
  - `src/app/(admin)/admin/company/**`
  - `src/app/api/admin/company/**`
  - AdminShell wiring only when needed to rename/link Agents → Company.
- Data must live under `admin_panel_companies/{tenantId}/…`, never under `companies/{id}/…`.
- Copy required normal-company UI into the isolated tree before editing; never “share” by changing normal modules.
- Keep backup/restore, PDF portal, online sync, and PL Server frozen unless the user explicitly asks to change that area.

## Product direction

- One Admin Panel Company for Pocket Ledger's own books: subscriber parties, subscription sales, bank/staff/tax/expense, and agent commission.
- Auto payment entries must be idempotent and system-generated; allow manual adjustments only in the isolated Admin Panel Company UI.
- Future PL Server Gold uses a local `tenantId` / `licenseId` shape with its own Admin Panel Company. Do not implement Gold installation or licensing unless explicitly requested.
